      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Duas Faces. Morpeko come sementes sem parar para controlar a fome. Se ficar muito tempo sem alimento, torna-se selvagem e brutal. Seu estômago é pequeno, por isso precisa consumir constantemente o que guarda nos bolsos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 6 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Morpeko Modo Satisfeito não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tail Whip, Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Power Trip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Flatter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bullet Seed, Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Aura Wheel, Thrash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Assurance, Attract, Baton Pass, Brick Break, Bullet Seed, Charge, Charge Beam, Crunch, Dark Pulse, Double-Edge, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fire Fang, Fling, Foul Play, Ice Fang, Knock Off, Lash Out, Nasty Plot, Outrage, Payback, Protect, Psychic Fangs, Rest, Revenge, Reversal, Rising Voltage, Round, Scary Face, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snore, Spite, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Super Fang, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Fang, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Uproar, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Charge, Fake Out, Parting Shot, Quash, Rapid Spin, Super Fang, Swagger, Tickle</p>",
